# reports/static/.gitkeep
# =============================================================================
# This directory stores all STATIC analysis reports.
# Reports are grouped by scan_id — one subdirectory per scan.
# =============================================================================
#
# FUTURE DIRECTORY STRUCTURE:
#
#   reports/static/
#   ├── SCAN-550e8400/
#   │   ├── terraform-discovery.json      — Discovered Terraform modules
#   │   ├── checkov-report.json           — Raw Checkov output
#   │   ├── normalized-findings.json      — Normalized findings with scan_id
#   │   ├── policy-results.json           — OPA/Rego/Conftest violations
#   │   └── static-risk-score.json        — Initial risk score (pre-deployment)
#   │
#   ├── SCAN-a1b2c3d4/
#   │   ├── terraform-discovery.json
#   │   ├── checkov-report.json
#   │   └── ...
#   │
#   └── SCAN-ff001122/
#       └── ...
#
# DESIGN NOTES:
#   - Each scan_id subdirectory is completely isolated
#   - Multiple scans (different repos, or same repo scanned again) produce
#     separate, non-overlapping report directories
#   - All files inside each subdirectory carry the scan_id field in their JSON
#   - Entire directories are uploaded as GitHub Actions Artifacts per scan_id
#
# All JSON report files are excluded from Git via .gitignore.
# Only this .gitkeep file is tracked by Git.
# =============================================================================
